Subject: [PATCH] susfs: backport v2.3.0 from Android 12 5.10 to caymanslm 4.9

Source: ShirkNeko/susfs4ksu gki-android12-5.10
Commit: f3b5aecf53ff8b3296603071b91383f6be6c7cbb (SUSFS v2.3.0)
Target: LineageOS android_kernel_lge_sdm845 4.9.337

Backport of the v2.3.0 kernel side onto this pre-statx 4.9 tree. Carries the
sus_path, sus_mount, sus_kstat, open_redirect, cmdline/uname spoof and sus_map
logic. The v2.3.0 sus_kstat rework routes its spoof decision through statx's
result_mask, which does not exist before 5.10; fs/stat.c bridges it locally
(susfs_kstat_spoof) via the STATX_SUS_KSTAT / STATX_SUS_KSTAT_FUSE markers so
the 4.9 generic_fillattr / vfs_getattr_nosec path keeps spoofing. The 5.10-only
sus_kstat statfs/fdinfo/proc-fd spoofers and the KSU-sucompat (TIF_PROC_NO_SU)
reworks are intentionally not adopted on this tree. Includes the v2.3.0
clone_mnt() race fix and the __lookup_mnt zygote_next hardening.

---
diff --git a/fs/Makefile b/fs/Makefile
index 3cfd698..5b4103c 100644
--- a/fs/Makefile
+++ b/fs/Makefile
@@ -13,6 +13,8 @@ obj-y :=	open.o read_write.o file_table.o super.o \
 		pnode.o splice.o sync.o utimes.o \
 		stack.o fs_struct.o statfs.o fs_pin.o nsfs.o
 
+obj-$(CONFIG_KSU_SUSFS) += susfs.o
+
 ifeq ($(CONFIG_BLOCK),y)
 obj-y +=	buffer.o block_dev.o direct-io.o mpage.o
 else
